++    "why_this_order": "Each play reads what the play before it wrote. /shape-plan reads the slice that /shape-slice wrote; /shape-eval reads the epic and stories that /shape-plan wrote and the hidden file that /shape-slice wrote (ADR 049 Decision 1; #818 needs #795, #798 needs #818)."
